window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Destined to be together, forbidden to love, two lost souls fight evil in an everyday world that belongs to the night. A dark romantasy by a </b><b><i>New York Times</i></b><b> and </b><b><i>USA Today</i></b><b> bestselling author.</b></p> <p>My life is a nightmare. I’m tormented by the evils I’ve seen, but still I hunt. Kill.</p> <p>My only comfort is Aria, my forbidden soulmate, whom I meet each night to fight an unseen war. When that war spills over and endangers her, there is nothing that can stop me from finding my love.</p> <p>Giving in to our blazing attraction could be the death of us, but with one brush of her hand, I’m willing to break every oath I’ve made.</p> <p>I’d burn the world to protect her from the evils that hunt us.</p> <p>Because for one moment of loving Aria? I would gladly give my life.</p>"; 
